    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2688" root="بض" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَضِيضَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَضٌّ</span>, near the end of the paragraph. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>Rain little in quantity.</i> (Sgh, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُضَاضَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <i>A thing which the hand possesses.</i> (K.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْرَجْتُ لَهُ بَضِيضَتِى</span> <i>I produced to him
what my hand possessed.</i> (TA.)

